  "header": {
    "subsystemType": "Hrot.Scenario",
    "schemaVersion": "1.0",
    "terrainName": "test-town",
    "description": "What: LLM commander DUEL (DESIGN_LLM_Commander §8, §11 L-4 pre-test, backend 2026-11-23) - llm-platoon-attack with Red under a commander too: Blue's body-less Platoon (seat) over Alpha Squad and Bravo Squad (4 men each) from behind the L-Block; Red Platoon (TKB 305, Hostile, seat) over the Defenders (5 men, SquadDefend at the sheds 'house') and Reserve (4 men, just west of them), with a 'rear' place at (30,110). Two seats on one chat endpoint: the relay (scripts/llm/chat_standin.py --mode relay --per-commander) routes each side's requests to its own worker. Places by side (DESIGN_LLM_Commander §5a-5 D-2): 'house' is Neutral (both sides know it); 'objective', 'support', 'start' are Blue's (Friend); 'rear' is Red's (Hostile) - each seat is told only its own side's and the Neutral ones. Judge: both commanders open and order their squads; each side's squads report to their own commander; the fight happens and lasts; the run reaches its time limit (two seats never stop the clock). Fail: a seat that never orders, a report to the wrong commander, the run frozen. Check: HROT_COMMANDER_MIND=ChatModel + the per-commander relay (STATUS_Backend_LLM_Commander.md §Duel); the scripted mind also runs it (Red's scripted commander then advances to 'objective' - a meeting engagement, judged by the same rows)."
  },
